%N A062752 Row sums of unsigned N(4) staircase array A062751.
%F A062752 a(n)=N(4; n, -1) with the row polynomials N(4; n, x) defined in A062751.
%F A062752 a(n)=sum(((-1)^(n-j))*2^(3*j+1)*A002293(j), j=1..n)+(-1)^n, with A002293(j)= A062993(j+2, 2)= binomial(4*j, j)/(3*j+1).
%F A062752 From _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Sep 04 2026: (Start)
%F A062752 Recurrence: 3*n*(3*n - 1)*(3*n + 1)*a(n) = (2021*n^3 - 3072*n^2 + 1411*n - 192)*a(n-1) + 64*(2*n - 1)*(4*n - 3)*(4*n - 1)*a(n-2).
%F A062752 a(n) ~ 2^(11*n + 25/2) / (2075 * sqrt(Pi) * n^(3/2) * 3^(3*n + 3/2)). (End)
%t A062752 Table[(-1)^n + Sum[(-1)^(n-j) * 2^(3*j+1) * Binomial[4*j, j] / (3*j+1), {j, 1, n}], {n, 0, 20}] (* _Vaclav Kotesovec_, Sep 04 2026 *)
